/-! Finite forward correspondence for the actual compatible match head.
Independent source allocation determines the selected lexical environment;
the emitted marked prefix supplies the actual typed captures and frame.
Arm and default contracts are structural induction interfaces. -/
set_option autoImplicit false
namespace Solcore.SourceSemantics.CoreLowering.CompatibleMatchPreservation
open Core Frontend SourceInference GeneralHeap ReadOnly CompatiblePayload CoreProof
